    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="text-center">Public D&amp;D Campaign Listings And Campaign Hubs</h1>
      <p>
        Use Public Wyrlds to browse campaign listings, onboard new players, and move accepted groups into persistent
        shared campaign spaces.
      </p>
      <small>
        <a href="/wyrlds/public">Open Public Directory</a>
        |
        <a href="/play-dungeons-and-dragons-online">Play D&amp;D Online</a>
      </small>
      <hr>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-links" aria-label="Page sections">
      <a href="#what">Campaign Listings</a>
      <a href="#join">Join Flow</a>
